    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827548165830033408",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827548165830033408",
      "title": "My latest Guardian Books cartoon ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s640x960/f15fe4ed4db53f833afb613b2c79361ea13b10ae.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1135\" data-orig-width=\"2048\" alt=\"Hercule Poirot dressed all in black speaks to Captain Hastings in a grand hallway &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Please ask the suspects to gather in the library, Hastings: I wish to reveal that our births are random, our lives meaningless, and our deaths absurd.&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;  Caption &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Having investigated so many awful murders over the years, it was perhaps unsurprising that Hercule Poirot turned to Existentialism&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;   p.s. Poirot had presumably been reading a lot of Sartre recently&#xE2;&#x80;&#xA6;   &quot;It is meaningless that we live and it is meaningless that we die,&quot; Jean-Paul Sartre, Being and Nothingness (L'&#xC3;&#x8A;tre et le N&#xC3;&#xA9;ant)  &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Every existing thing is born without reason, prolongs itself out of weakness, and dies by chance.&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D; Jean-Paul Sartre, Nausea (La Naus&#xC3;&#xA9;e)\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s75x75_c1/7c48a9623d92c1786ad651a8b9b3928e23050956.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s100x200/38e46f61a162936e579c3af579849c8cff69dbdb.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s250x400/d0edd87f23ff77903fd992c89161206903a08ef0.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s400x600/f8f8435db8076f5d9d99d03a024346d28b6c9306.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s500x750/302e5c4fffa98ca8f2a09499ba82b32ecf7426ed.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s540x810/be4cf692b334e934bddff3e234781be0b1f6cf63.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s640x960/f15fe4ed4db53f833afb613b2c79361ea13b10ae.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s1280x1920/80acb58977b233a7d56eea84b0468eb9186baeb8.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/03209e6924ff6823ebeccb51afabe1ce/5e5d193272bd5c68-c5/s2048x3072/9e523cae38b78c3319c44ba550628b1ff2f80edf.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
