      "title": "Notebook doodle and original art for a recent cartoon. \nThe drawing is available at tomgauld.com&hellip;",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s640x960/ddd7ff7e541ae5ff9b6e236f5db1ec22df6e709f.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1351\" data-orig-width=\"1843\" alt=\"A small scatchy ink drawing.&#10;A reader walks past bookcases, ghosts and clouds of ectoplasm.&#10;Title: Haunted library is cool.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s75x75_c1/a9ae11821bbdebea9180b52f6cada3148a1e94a1.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s100x200/7a630c69969e8e1fd95b003facffdc2beb9cf53d.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s250x400/944f38f413b8261505f058b61658c7ff4300d793.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s400x600/321d143c873874110d87e597e07659d109e53804.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s500x750/d3465489ddeae3a0e838c57e23d477cd8d39fe40.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s540x810/2dc56361043e76a88dd5cc00f51542a4714f133b.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s640x960/ddd7ff7e541ae5ff9b6e236f5db1ec22df6e709f.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s1280x1920/7e62bf749ad9e57f9a483961e713678a34b356e3.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/f8af7ddf23b99bf0cff1f7476c954308/6fb37aa66a5422d3-11/s2048x3072/245bd7112673f4b217e3ec0f925e830afeb823d7.jpg 1843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>\n<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s640x960/82419e81e823d11db7e8e6974e6f8c496da29e64.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1351\" data-orig-width=\"1843\" alt=\" Title: Who is Haunting The Library of Forbidden Tomes? Image: five panels showing characters in a gothic library 22% - tormented souls, frozen between life and death (a ghost reading a book) 4% - dank, fetid horrors from the icy depths below (a black slug like creature with a single eyestalk reading a book) 15% - cold, lifeless bones possessed by a corrupt sorcery (a skeleton reading a book) 11% - frigid and malevolent ectoplasmic vapours (a shapeless apparition reading a book) 48% - regular readers happy to away from the heatwave (A mother, small child and toddler in buggy, all reading books)\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s75x75_c1/668c6f5271ccaa677a1847cfae3a83929d05fe7a.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s100x200/6ef518c3758c639fa16c9d9195031de73f0adfad.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s250x400/d3706988639b6e4b94492bb78e902c8a5a0b446d.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s400x600/5bb510e4c1e6db978b75a83f2eb6813023943798.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s500x750/5599deb95a9a4dd7759cf6d1ccc4d1d532cbb1ac.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s540x810/c08f3b9e0e7c25b20a751a3dbaddbccaa081e6d5.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s640x960/82419e81e823d11db7e8e6974e6f8c496da29e64.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s1280x1920/146123834773a1c3f5053feb5f28c17f436d52a2.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bc0c06b7a253d1b9b9bf7ff1c6641d49/6fb37aa66a5422d3-dc/s2048x3072/b7c91a0ff50c6787be9817a5fc7523de5df82905.jpg 1843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
